otic pet requires special consideration. From reptiles and amphibians to birds and small mammals, discover 150+ names perfect for bearded dragons, snakes, parrots, hedgehogs, and all unusual companions.</p></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/blog/first-week-pet-naming-guide/\"><div class=\"text-3xl mb-3\">📝</div><span class=\"text-xs bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\">Pet Names</span><h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-800 mt-2 group-hover:text-primary line-clamp-2\">First Week Naming Guide: How to Name Your New Pet Right 📝</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 line-clamp-2\">The first week with your new pet is the perfect time to find their forever name. Learn a proven step-by-step process for observing, testing, and choosing the perfect name — with tips from veterinarians and professional trainers.</p></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/blog/names-that-match-pet-colors/\"><div class=\"text-3xl mb-3\">🎨</div><span class=\"text-xs bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\">Pet Names</span><h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-800 mt-2 group-hover:text-primary line-clamp-2\">Names That Match Your Pet&#x27;s Colors: A Complete Visual Guide 🎨</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 line-clamp-2\">Match your pet&#x27;s name to their unique coat color. From snowy whites to midnight blacks, golden oranges to cool grays — discover 120+ color-inspired names organized by shade for dogs, cats, and all pets.</p></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/blog/trending-pet-names-2025/\"><div class=\"text-3xl mb-3\">🔥</div><span class=\"text-xs bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounde