\"92\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Dog the Bounty Hunter</strong> — Fun to say and easy for your pet to recognize, this name checks all the boxes.\"}}]\n66:[\"$\",\"p\",\"93\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Chairman Meow</strong> — This name captures the essence of a loyal and loving friend who brightens every day.\"}}]\n67:[\"$\",\"h3\",\"94\",{\"className\":\"text-xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-3 text-gray-800\",\"children\":[\"81–90\"]}]\n68:[\"$\",\"p\",\"95\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Mutt Damon</strong> — A unique choice that reflects your pet's one-of-a-kind personality and charm.\"}}]\n69:[\"$\",\"p\",\"96\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Droolius Caesar</strong> — A unique choice that reflects your pet's one-of-a-kind personality and charm.\"}}]\n6a:[\"$\",\"p\",\"97\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Barky McBarkface</strong> — Inspired by pop culture, this name works great for pets that have a dramatic flair or star quality.\"}}]\n6b:[\"$\",\"p\",\"98\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Woofgang Amadeus</strong> — Fun to say and easy for your pet to recognize, this name checks all the boxes.\"}}]\n6c:[\"$\",\"p\",\"99\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Salvador Dogi</strong> — This name captures the essence of a loyal and loving friend who brightens every day.\"}}]\n6d:[\"$\",\"p\",\"100\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Obi-Wan Kenobi</strong> — A clever twist that suits a smart and mischievous companion who always keeps you laughing.\"}}]\n6e:[\"$\",\"p\",\"101\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Luke Skybarker</strong> — With a name like this, your pet is sure to be the talk of the dog park — in the best way possible.\"}}]\n6f:[\"$\",\"p\",\"102\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Pablo Escobark</strong> — Inspired by pop culture, this name works great for pets that have a dramatic flair or star quality.\"}}]\n70:[\"$\",\"p\",\"103\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Gandalf the Greyhound</strong> — A unique choice that reflects your pet's one-of-a-kind personality and charm.\"}}]\n71:[\"$\",\"p\",\"104\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Brad Pitbull</strong> — This name captures the essence of a loyal and loving friend who brightens every day.\"}}]\n72:[\"$\",\"h3\",\"105\",{\"className\":\"text-xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-3 text-gray-800\",\"children\":[\"91–93\"]}]\n73:[\"$\",\"p\",\"106\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Frodo Baggins</strong> — Fun to say and easy for your pet to recognize, this name checks all the boxes.\"}}]\n74:[\"$\",\"p\",\"107\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Sherlock Bones</strong> — This name has a timeless quality that works for pets of any age, breed, or temperament.\"}}]\n75:[\"$\",\"p\",\"108\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Tsunami</strong> — This name captures the essence of a loyal and loving friend who brightens every day.\"}}]\n76:[\"$\",\"p\",\"109\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"These 200 names represent a diverse collection spanning multiple styles, origins, and inspirations. Each one has been carefully selected for quality and memorability.\"]}]\n77:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"110\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"🎯 Expert Tips & Best Practices\"]}]\n78:[\"$\",\"p\",\"111\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>1. Keep It Short:</strong> One to two syllables is ideal. Names like Max, Luna, or Charlie are easy for pets to recognize and for you to say quickly.\"}}]\n79:[\"$\",\"p\",\"112\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>2. Avoid Command Confusion:</strong> Don't choose names that sound like common commands. \\\"Kit\\\" sounds like \\\"sit,\\\" \\\"Bo\\\" sounds like \\\"no,\\\" and \\\"Fletch\\\" sounds like \\\"fetch.\\\" This can confuse your pet during training.\"}}]\n7a:[\"$\",\"p\",\"113\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>3. Consider Longevity:</strong> A name that's cute for a kitten or puppy should still suit a full-grown cat or dog. \\\"Tiny\\\" might be adorable for a puppy but ironic for a 100-pound adult dog.\"}}]\n7b:[\"$\",\"p\",\"114\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>4. Test the \\\"Backdoor Test\\\":</strong> Stand at your back door and call the name loudly three times. If you feel embarrassed, keep looking. You'll be doing this regularly!\"}}]\n7c:[\"$\",\"p\",\"115\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>5. Use Positive Association:</strong> Always pair the name with positive experiences — treats, pets, play. Never use your pet's name when scolding them.\"}}]\n7d:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"116\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"⚠️ Common Mistakes to Avoid\"]}]\n7e:[\"$\",\"p\",\"117\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Rushing the Decision:</strong> Take your time. Most new pet owners feel pressure to name their pet immediately, but waiting a few days to understand their personality leads to better choices.\"}}]\n7f:[\"$\",\"p\",\"118\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Choosing Names Too Similar to Family Members:</strong> A pet named \\\"Molly\\\" when your daughter's friend is also Molly can create awkward situations. Check that the name doesn't overlap with people in your immediate circle.\"}}]\n80:[\"$\",\"p\",\"119\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Names That Are Hard to Spell or Pronounce:</strong> You'll need to spell your pet's name for vet records, microchip registration, and insurance. X Æ A-12 might be a famous baby name, but it's impractical for daily pet life.\"}}]\n81:[\"$\",\"p\",\"120\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Ignoring Breed Heritage:</strong> A Scottish Terrier named \\\"Haggis\\\" or a Shiba Inu named \\\"Mochi\\\" connects your pet to its breed heritage. Consider names that honor your pet's origins.\"}}]\n82:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"121\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"🔗 Explore More Name Ideas\"]}]\n83:[\"$\",\"p\",\"122\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"Looking for more inspiration? Browse our complete collection of name generators: \",[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"81\",{\"href\":\"/animal/caterpillar/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Caterpillar\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\" names, \",[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"102\",{\"href\":\"/animal/hornbill/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Hornbill\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\" names, \",[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"120\",{\"href\":\"/animal/mongoose/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Mongoose\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\" names, \",[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"138\",{\"href\":\"/animal/falcon/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Falcon\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\" names, and \",[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"158\",{\"href\":\"/animal/nyala/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Nyala\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\" names. Each generator features 160+ hand-picked names across 9 unique categories including male, female, cute, funny, fantasy, unique, cool, and baby names.\"]}]\n84:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-12 bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\",\"children\":\"❓ Frequently Asked Questions\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"details\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"What are the most popular fish names?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Popular fish names include Nemo, Bubbles, Goldie, Finley, and Sushi. The best name depends on your fish's color, species, and personality. Betta fish often get exotic names while goldfish suit classic, friendly names.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"How do I choose a name for my betta fish?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Betta fish are known for their flowing fins and vibrant colors. Choose names that reflect their beauty — think mythological names like Poseidon, color-based names like Ruby or Sapphire, or elegant names like Aria or Kai.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Should I name my fish based on its color?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Color-based names are a popular choice! Orange fish might be Goldie, Sunny, or Tiger. Blue fish could be Azure, Neptune, or Lapis. White fish often get names like Pearl, Snowball, or Ghost.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Can fish recognize their names?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"While fish don't respond to names the way dogs do, some species like betta fish and goldfish can learn to recognize their owners and associate certain sounds with feeding time. A short, distinct name helps with this recognition.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"What are good names for a pair of fish?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Themed pairs are popular: Bonnie & Clyde, Salt & Pepper, Yin & Yang, Mario & Luigi, or Peanut Butter & Jelly. Choose names that complement each other and reflect your fishes' relationship.\"}]]}]]}]]}]\n85:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-12\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\",\"children\":\"🐾 Related Animal Name Generators\"}],[\"$\"